# P13 batch 3
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0421:00A1"
msgid "Mythran"
msgstr "米斯蘭"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0421:00C6"
msgid "mage "
msgstr "法師"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0421:00E3"
msgid "man "
msgstr "男人"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 0421:021A"
msgid "Very well. "
msgstr "很好。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 0421:038A"
msgid "There is only one spell which I have bothered to transcribe onto scrolls. This spell enables the caster to dispel magics that seal entryways and portals. Unlike other spells, you do not need to learn this spell before casting it. However, the magics upon the scroll will disappear after you read it, so you may use each spell of opening once. "
msgstr "我只費心把一種法術抄寫到捲軸上。這種法術能讓施法者驅散封住入口與傳送門的魔法。和其他法術不同，你不必先學會就能施展。不過，捲軸上的魔力在你唸過之後就會消失，所以每張開啟之術只能用一次。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 0421:03E0"
msgid "You wish to buy the Scroll of Dispelling Magical Portals? "
msgstr "你想買驅散傳送門捲軸嗎？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "ask 0421"
msgid "Nay. "
msgstr "不。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "Aye. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0421"
msgid "Aye. "
msgstr "是的。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "Aye. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:04D0"
msgid "Since the ink and parchment do have a cost to them, as well as the time I take to transcribe the magical words, I must ask you for 50 obsidians. "
msgstr "墨水和羊皮紙都要成本，抄寫咒文也要花我時間，所以我得向你收五十枚黑曜石幣。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "Aye. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:052B"
msgid "As you know, I must charge you 50 obsidians for the scroll. "
msgstr "如你所知，這張捲軸我得收你五十枚黑曜石幣。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "" or "Nay. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:0595"
msgid "Perhaps you wish to discuss something other than scrolls. "
msgstr "也許你想談談捲軸以外的事。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "" or "Nay. "
msgctxt "ask 0421"
msgid "I cannot pay that. "
msgstr "我付不起。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "I will pay that. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0421"
msgid "I will pay that. "
msgstr "我付。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "I will pay that. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:0685"
msgid "Excellent. Use this well. "
msgstr "很好。好好運用它。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "I will pay that. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:06CF"
msgid "Excellent. Use this well. "
msgstr "很好。好好運用它。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "I will pay that. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:079A"
msgid "My friend, it seems you have not the obsidian for this. Of course, I realize you were not attempting to fool me, but perhaps you should return later when you can pay the fee. "
msgstr "朋友，看來你的黑曜石幣不夠。當然，我明白你並不是想騙我，不過也許等你付得起費用時再來吧。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "I cannot pay that. "
msgctxt "bark 0421:0832"
msgid "I am sorry that I cannot help you then. Perhaps you should return later when you can pay the fee. "
msgstr "那我很抱歉幫不上忙了。也許等你付得起費用時再來吧。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:088F"
msgid "Perhaps you wish to discuss something other than scrolls. "
msgstr "也許你想談談捲軸以外的事。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:0925"
msgid "Do you wish to purchase the reagents of Necromancy, Sorcery, or those specific to Thaumaturgy? "
msgstr "你想買死靈術、巫術的材料，還是奇蹟術專用的材料？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:09DE"
msgid "You do realize that I only have reagents for the spells I teach. Do you wish to purchase the reagents of Necromancy, Sorcery, or those specific to Thaumaturgy? "
msgstr "你應該明白，我只有我所教授法術的材料。你想買死靈術、巫術的材料，還是奇蹟術專用的材料？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "ask 0421"
msgid "Nevermind. "
msgstr "算了。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after "Necromancy. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
