#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:141E"
msgid "Perhaps you are not so interested in reagents after all. "
msgstr "也許你終究對材料沒那麼有興趣。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:14E1"
msgid "You are ready for the final spell that I can teach you -- the spell that permits travel through the very Ether itself. "
msgstr "你已經準備好學習我能教你的最後一道法術了——能讓你穿越以太本身的法術。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:1533"
msgid "It is too early for you to learn another spell. "
msgstr "現在學下一道法術還太早。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:15BA"
msgid "You are ready for your fifth lesson in Thaumaturgy -- the spell of complete devastation. "
msgstr "你已經準備好上奇蹟術的第五課了——徹底毀滅的法術。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:160C"
