msgstr "現在學下一道法術還太早。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:1673"
msgid "You are ready for your fourth spell -- Call Destruction. "
msgstr "你已經準備好學第四道法術了——呼喚毀滅。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:16C5"
