msgstr "現在學下一道法術還太早。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 10 (enterFastArea), after ""
msgctxt "bark 0421:174A"
msgid "You are ready for your third lesson in Thaumaturgy -- the spell of creature summoning. "
msgstr "你已經準備好上奇蹟術的第三課了——召喚生物的法術。"

# P13 batch 3
